\cf2 <$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Hello, Chanta, old mate. I\'92m sorry I can\'92t be with you right now, and, look, now that I\'92ve pressed the record button, I\'92m fighting every reactive impulse to tell you all this in person. But I know it wouldn\'92t serve you\'97it wouldn\'92t serve you well to carry this until it\'92s time. The more you know, the more danger you\'92ll be in. And the sooner you know it, the sooner and deeper the danger.\
